## Verification

After configuring:

1. Create a simple TypeScript file:
```typescript
// src/test.ts
export interface TestType {
  value: string;
}

export class TestClass {
  constructor(private data: string) {}
  getData(): string {
    return this.data;
  }
}
```

2. Compile:
```bash
tsc
```

3. Check output:
```bash
ls dist/
# Should see:
# test.js
# test.d.ts
# test.d.ts.map (if declarationMap: true)
# test.js.map (if sourceMap: true)
```

4. Verify .d.ts content:
```bash
cat dist/test.d.ts
# Should show type definitions
```

